---

# Security Controls

| Control | Implementation |
|----------|----------------|
| Encryption | AWS KMS Customer Managed Key |
| Key Rotation | Enabled |
| Least Privilege | IAM Key Policies |
| Administrative Separation | Dedicated Administrator Permissions |
| Service Authorization | Service Principal Access |
| Resource Protection | prevent_destroy |
| Auditability | AWS CloudTrail Integration |
| Governance | Enterprise Tagging |

---

# Module Inputs

The module accepts a single enterprise configuration object:

```hcl
kms = {
  name
  alias
  description

  key_spec
  key_usage

  rotation_enabled
  multi_region
  deletion_window_in_days

  access = {
    administrators
    users
    service_principals
  }

  additional_policy_documents

  tags
}
